---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Why Relaflow | Relationship Infrastructure Built for Sustainable Growth"
  description="Relaflow helps organizations organize relationship data, build practical CRM and workflow systems, identify opportunities and manage the relationships that support sustainable growth."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="About"
    title="Good relationships can get lost in bad systems."
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/80">
      <p>
        As organizations grow, the information behind their most important
        relationships tends to scatter. Some of it lives in spreadsheets.
        Some in inboxes. Some across different platforms nobody fully trusts.
        And some only in the heads of the people who happen to manage that
        relationship, which is a risk the moment they're busy, on leave or gone.
      </p>

      <p>
        The result is familiar. It gets harder to know who to follow up with,
        where the real opportunities are, what's actually happening across your
        relationships, and what needs attention right now.
      </p>

      <p>
        Relaflow brings that work into a clearer system.
      </p>

      <p>
        We help you organize your relationship data, build CRM and workflow
        systems people actually use, identify the opportunities that are easy
        to miss, and create better ways to manage the relationships that carry
        your organization forward.
      </p>

      <p>
        The goal is simple. Make relationships easier to manage, opportunities
        easier to see, and growth easier to sustain.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12">
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="rounded bg-teal px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-navy transition-colors hover:bg-teal-deep hover:text-white"
      >
        Contact Us
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>